# Skills: Testing

Purpose:
  Testing skills for SDDRA system. Defines test automation,
  coverage requirements, and testing standards.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @automation.sdd

Rules:
  [T1] All code MUST have tests.
  [T2] Test coverage MUST be >= 80%.
  [T3] All tests MUST pass before push.
  [T4] No flaky tests allowed.
  [T5] Critical paths MUST have integration tests.

Navigation:
  Automation: @automation.sdd

State: +
